<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8314" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circum-spergo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-spargo</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Apic. 8, 8, § 406</span></i>; cf.
		aspergo), ĕre, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To sprinkle</i>, <i>strew</i>, or <i>scatter something around</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaternos modios stercoris caprini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 87</span></i>
			: impensam talem, Apic. l. l.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To sprinkle with something all around</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se purificantes aquā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 8,
					1, 1, § 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
